  "body": "Roughly based on https://miketaylr.com/posts/2014/05/window-orientation-shim.html.\n\nRich pointed out there will be problems, but for now I guess we can live with that (potentially misoriented sites are better than totally broken sites, IMO). I think we can define an arbitrary mapping between https://w3c.github.io/screen-orientation/#orientationtype-enum and whatever ipods and iphones do.\n",
